      "id": "stylesheets-outside-the-build",
      "lines": [
        "css holds 3 stylesheets, 420 B, and no page of this build loads any of them: no entry in js is named after one, and none is reached from an entry that is.",
        "  Loaded from PHP: hide_default_login.css (lib/AlternativeLogin/DefaultLogin.php), hide_default_login_button.css (lib/AlternativeLogin/DefaultLogin.php), hide_oauth2_login.css (lib/AlternativeLogin/ChurchToolsLogin.php).",
        "  Each is loaded from PHP or built into the bundle, so none is left without a loader. Where the build writes its stylesheets somewhere else, --css=DIR names that directory."
      ]
    },
